title: "Strangers in the Comment Section: An Introductory Analysis of Comments on an American's RedNote Videos"

abstract: >
  An exploratory computational communication research project
  analyzing audience comments on six RedNote videos. The project
  uses Python, Chinese-language text processing, thematic coding,
  and sentiment analysis to examine differences in audience
  interaction between Chinese media-related content and
  Chinglish challenge videos.

